{"execution_delta":{"candidate_count":5,"plan_ref":"rounds/round_0004/plan.json","schema_version":"algorithm-optimization-execution-delta/v1"},"plan":{"direction":"Build on Round 3's breakthrough (-0.1576) by adding Law-of-Cosines depot-ray angular coherence cos(theta_0), steeper capacity-adaptive voluntary early return, and a two-phase remaining-fleet depot-start policy.","hypothesis":"H-006: Angular petal coherence cos(theta_0) plus two-phase remaining-fleet depot-start and steeper capacity-adaptive early return resolves the dev-vs-large-scale trade-off while pushing below -0.160 on dev4.","operations":[{"mechanism":"Compute scale-free cos(theta_0) = clip((d0i^2 + d0j^2 - dij^2) / max(2*d0i*d0j, 1e-12), -1, 1) from distance_matrix alone and reward candidates aligned on the same radial petal (subtract w_cos * cos(theta_0), w_cos in 0.10-0.30) alongside linear radial pull (d_cur - alpha*d_dep)/scale and elongation rho.","target":"Law-of-Cosines depot-ray angular coherence term at current_node != depot","type":"add"},{"mechanism":"At current_node == depot, use remaining-fleet estimate rem_routes = sum(demands[unvisited]) / rest_capacity: prefer outside-in heavy-far clearing when many routes remain (rem_routes > 6-8) and compact radial-load seed when few routes remain. Mid-route, test a steeper adaptive early-return slope tau = tau_0 + tau_1 * min(1, mean_dem / rest_capacity) (tau_0 in 0.22-0.32, tau_1 in 0.25-0.50) returning depot when 1 - rho < tau.","target":"depot-start boundary (current_node == depot) and adaptive early-return threshold","type":"replace"},{"mechanism":"Keep every term strictly dimensionless (no raw demand/distance division or +1.0 length offsets) and verify early return triggers only when current_node != depot.","target":"strict coordinate scale invariance and Round 3's linear+rho+fill balance","type":"preserve"}],"ref":"rounds/round_0004/plan.json","semantic_alignment":"unassessed","sha256":"0013a8fcab86226b886b2b7a041f3068b214e68dfd2553dacd2c4e